chat.busy_multiplayer.1 = {name}: Sorry, I'm talking to someone else right now.
chat.busy_multiplayer.2 = {name}: Hold on a sec, I'm in the middle of a chat!
chat.busy_multiplayer.3 = {name}: My bad, I'm busy talking to someone else.
chat.cancel.1 = {name}: Alright, see you later! Just call if you need anything.
chat.cancel.2 = {name}: Okay, I'm off! Let me know if you need me.
chat.cancel.3 = {name}: Sure thing! See you around!
chat.magic.start.1 = {name}: Yay! Let's play MagicGinn. Think of an animal and answer with Yes or No.
chat.magic.start.2 = {name}: Cool! Think of an animal and let's play MagicGinn! Just say Yes or No.
chat.magic.start.3 = {name}: I love this game! Focus on an animal and I'll guess it. Answer Yes or No!
chat.magic.reject.1 = {name}: We are not close enough for me to play with you.
chat.magic.reject.2 = {name}: Hmm... I think we need to get to know each other better first.
chat.magic.reject.3 = {name}: Not really feeling like it right now. We barely talk!
chat.busy_job.1 = {name}: I'm already busy with my {job} job!
chat.busy_job.2 = {name}: I can't right now, I'm focused on my {job} duties!
chat.busy_job.3 = {name}: Sorry, I'm in the middle of working as a {job}!
chat.come.1 = {name}: I'm coming!
chat.come.2 = {name}: Be right there!
chat.come.3 = {name}: On my way, wait for me!
chat.greeting.1 = {name}: Hey, did you call? Need something? (Say 'fish', 'mine', etc)
chat.greeting.2 = {name}: What's up! How are you doing? (Say 'fish', 'mine', etc)
chat.greeting.3 = {name}: Hi! Do you have a mission for me? (Say 'fish', 'mine', etc)
chat.greeting.4 = {name}: I'm here. What do you want me to do? (Say 'fish', 'mine', etc)
chat.greeting.5 = {name}: Hey! Ready to work. Tell me what you need. (Say 'fish', 'mine', etc)
chat.smalltalk.1 = {name}: Hey! It's a great day to explore, isn't it?
chat.smalltalk.2 = {name}: Yo! Everything alright over there?
chat.smalltalk.3 = {name}: That's crazy! But hey, any news?
chat.smalltalk.4 = {name}: Haha, for sure. You always come up with these ideas.
chat.smalltalk.5 = {name}: Yeah, exactly! I was just thinking about what we should do tomorrow.
chat.smalltalk.6 = {name}: Uh-huh... You know, I'm kind of craving something to eat right now.
chat.smalltalk.7 = {name}: Oh, definitely! I was thinking the exact same thing!
chat.smalltalk.8 = {name}: Be careful with the monsters at night, I heard some weird noises yesterday...
chat.smalltalk.9 = {name}: Ah, nice. But hey, do you want to do something together?
chat.smalltalk.10 = {name}: Interesting... although I'm mostly focused on working and earning some coins.
chat.magic.win.1 = {name}: I know! The animal you thought of is: {animal_name}!
chat.magic.win.2 = {name}: Too easy! You thought of a {animal_name}!
chat.magic.win.3 = {name}: Ha! Guessed it! It's a {animal_name}!
chat.magic.lose.1 = {name}: I couldn't guess! You beat me!
chat.magic.lose.2 = {name}: Wow, that was hard. You win this time!
chat.magic.lose.3 = {name}: I give up! What was it? You're too good at this!
chat.magic.question.1 = {name}: Question {num}: {question}
chat.magic.question.2 = {name}: Here comes question {num}: {question}
chat.magic.question.3 = {name}: Tell me (Question {num}): {question}
chat.prof.reject.1 = {name}: You're not my boss! I won't change professions just because you told me to. (Requires 20 friendship)
chat.prof.reject.2 = {name}: Who gave you the right to boss me around? I'm not changing my job! (Requires 20 friendship)
chat.prof.reject.3 = {name}: I like what I do, why would I change it just for you? (Requires 20 friendship)
chat.prof.accept.1 = {name}: Very well, from today onwards I'll be a {prof_name}!
chat.prof.accept.2 = {name}: Alright! You can call me the newest {prof_name} in town!
chat.prof.accept.3 = {name}: I like the sound of that. I'll start working as a {prof_name} right now!
chat.prof.invalid.1 = {name}: I didn't understand what profession you want me to have. Try 'become a miner', 'become a farmer', etc.
chat.prof.invalid.2 = {name}: What profession is that? Try being clearer, like: 'become a miner'.
chat.prof.invalid.3 = {name}: Huh? I don't know that job. Say something like 'become a farmer'.
chat.job.wrong_prof.1 = {name}: Sorry, I'm a {prof_name} and I don't know how to do {job_name} work!
chat.job.wrong_prof.2 = {name}: I'm no good at {job_name}, my expertise is being a {prof_name}!
chat.job.wrong_prof.3 = {name}: Wait, I'm a {prof_name}, I have no clue how to work as a {job_name}.
chat.job.reject.1 = {name}: We barely know each other! I won't work for you for free. (Requires 10 friendship)
chat.job.reject.2 = {name}: Do you think I'm your servant? We're barely friends! (Requires 10 friendship)
chat.job.reject.3 = {name}: I'm not doing that, we hardly even talk. (Requires 10 friendship)
chat.job.accept.1 = {name}: Alright, getting ready to do {job_name} work!
chat.job.accept.2 = {name}: Cool, I'm heading out to start my {job_name} duties!
chat.job.accept.3 = {name}: Leave it to me, {job_name} work is about to begin.
tick.job.depart.1 = {name}: I'm leaving now! I'll be back as soon as I finish.
tick.job.depart.2 = {name}: I'm off! I'll be back later.
tick.job.depart.3 = {name}: Off to work! I'll finish up shortly.
tick.job.complete.1 = {name}: I finished my {job_name} work and came back!
tick.job.complete.2 = {name}: Phew, done with the {job_name} work. I'm back!
tick.job.complete.3 = {name}: Mission accomplished! The {job_name} job is complete.
tick.chat.timeout.1 = {name}: Hmm, I think you're busy. Let's talk later!
tick.chat.timeout.2 = {name}: You seem distracted... we can talk later!
tick.chat.timeout.3 = {name}: I see you're not in a chatting mood today. Bye!
cmd.spawn.usage = Correct usage: /simtale spawn [NPCType]
cmd.spawn.error = Error spawning NPC of type {type}.
cmd.spawn.success = Spawned NPC of type {type}!
cmd.reload.db = Reassembling NPCs from the database...
cmd.here.success = Called {count} NPCs to your position!
chat.magic.cancel.1 = {name}: Ah, what a shame! We can play later then.
chat.magic.cancel.2 = {name}: No problem, maybe next time!
chat.magic.cancel.3 = {name}: We'll leave the game for later, that's fine!
chat.magic.invalid.1 = {name}: I didn't get that! Answer: Yes, No, Don't know, or Quit.
chat.magic.invalid.2 = {name}: Invalid answer. It has to be Yes, No, Don't know, or Quit.
chat.magic.invalid.3 = {name}: Huh? Try again using Yes, No, Don't know, or Quit.
cmd.interact.none = No living NPCs nearby!
cmd.interact.success = Forced UI to open for {name}
reaper.soul_taken = §c{name}'s time is up. The Grim Reaper has taken their soul.
reaper.tombstone_given = §eYou kept a Rock_Stone_Cobble as a 'Tombstone' for {name}

# FRIENDLY GREETINGS
chat.friendly.greeting.1 = {name} smiles: Hello! Good to see you around today.
chat.friendly.greeting.2 = {name} waves: Hey! How are things?
chat.friendly.greeting.3 = {name}: Hey there! Any news in Orbis?
chat.friendly.greeting.4 = {name} smiles friendly: Hi! I'm glad you came to talk.
chat.friendly.greeting.5 = {name}: Hello! I was just wondering when we'd see each other again.

# TRAIT GREETINGS
chat.greedy.greeting.1 = {name} rubs their hands: Do you have any extra ore or items for me today?
chat.greedy.greeting.2 = {name} looks at your backpack: Hmm, so many shiny things in there... don't want to share?
chat.greedy.greeting.3 = {name} winks: Hello! Did you come to bring me gifts or just to chit-chat?
chat.paranoid.greeting.1 = {name} looks around sweating cold: Shh! Did you hear that?...
chat.paranoid.greeting.2 = {name} whispers nervously: They are watching us... act naturally!
chat.paranoid.greeting.3 = {name} pulls you aside: Did you see that bush move? I'm sure it was a Trork spy.
chat.lazy.greeting.1 = {name} yawns: Oh, hi... Wake me up when dinner is ready.
chat.lazy.greeting.2 = {name} stretches: Hi... So sleepy. Did you say something important?
chat.lazy.greeting.3 = {name} sighs lazily: Hi. If it's about work, tell them I'm not here.

# CONTEXTUAL GREETINGS
chat.context.bleeding = {name} widens their eyes: Oh my god, you're bleeding! Do you need help?!
chat.context.night = {name} whispers: It's dangerous to walk around here at night... Be careful.
chat.context.insulted.recent = {name} crosses their arms: What do you want? Haven't you insulted me enough today?
chat.context.insulted.other = {name} glares at you: I heard what you did to {otherName}. You better walk the line.
chat.context.missed = {name} widens their eyes: Wow, I haven't seen you in days! Where were you?!

# FUNNY
chat.funny.angry.1 = {name}: ...was that supposed to be funny?
chat.funny.angry.2 = {name} sighs: I'm not in the mood for jokes today.
chat.funny.angry.3 = {name} stares at you seriously: Please spare me from your jokes right now.
chat.funny.angry.4 = {name} shakes their head: Unfunny. Very unfunny.
chat.funny.angry.5 = {name} crosses their arms: I have real problems here and you come to me with jokes?
chat.funny.trait.1 = {name}: HAHAHA! Good one! You have a knack for comedy.
chat.funny.trait.2 = {name} laughs loudly: Oh my god, that was genius! I'll have to tell the others.
chat.funny.trait.3 = {name} cries laughing: Oh no, stop! My stomach hurts from laughing so much! Hahaha!
chat.funny.trait.4 = {name} gives you a friendly pat on the shoulder: Hahaha, you're quite a character! Loved it!
chat.funny.trait.5 = {name} laughs out loud: Very good! I knew you were funny, but that topped it.
chat.funny.normal.1 = You told a joke! {name} laughed a lot.
chat.funny.normal.2 = {name} gives a light chuckle: Heh, that was a good one. Thanks for the smile.
chat.funny.normal.3 = {name} smiles with humor: Nice try! I hadn't heard that one.
chat.funny.normal.4 = You shared a funny joke and {name} gave a beautiful smile.
chat.funny.normal.5 = {name} lets out a muffled laugh: Hahaha, ok, that was kinda cute.

# ROMANTIC
chat.romantic.reject.1 = {name}: Dude... what? Go away.
chat.romantic.reject.2 = {name} looks at you with disdain: Less, way less. We don't have that intimacy.
chat.romantic.reject.3 = {name} takes a step back: Please keep those comments to yourself.
chat.romantic.reject.4 = {name} crosses their arms rolling their eyes: I think you got the wrong person. Leave me alone.
chat.romantic.reject.5 = {name} says coldly: What a cheap pickup line. I don't fall for that.
chat.romantic.shy.1 = {name} blushes and looks away: T-thank you... you're not bad yourself.
chat.romantic.shy.2 = {name} stammers red: Ah... I-I... thank you. You take me by surprise like that.
chat.romantic.shy.3 = {name} covers their shy face: P-stop looking at me like that, it's making me awkward!
chat.romantic.shy.4 = {name} gives an embarrassed smile: You always say these things so suddenly... silly.
chat.romantic.shy.5 = {name} bites their lip in shame: Ah... thank you for the compliment. I'm happy.
chat.romantic.normal.1 = {name}: Heh... keep talking. I'm enjoying listening.
chat.romantic.normal.2 = {name} winks: Really? Who knows, if you insist a little more...
chat.romantic.normal.3 = {name} smirks: Well look at that, a charmer around here. Interesting.
chat.romantic.normal.4 = {name} smiles confidently: I know I'm amazing, but it's always good to hear it from you.
chat.romantic.normal.5 = {name} gives a charming smile: You really know how to charm someone, don't you?

# MEAN
chat.mean.aggressive.1 = {name} draws their weapon: You want to settle this right now?!
chat.mean.aggressive.2 = {name} clenches their fists: Repeat that to my face if you have the guts!
chat.mean.aggressive.3 = {name} pushes you: Who do you think you are to talk to me like that?!
chat.mean.aggressive.4 = {name} yells furiously: Shut up before I make you shut up!
chat.mean.aggressive.5 = {name} spits on the ground: You'll regret opening that mouth.
chat.mean.needy.1 = {name} almost cries: Why are you so mean to me? What did I do to you?
chat.mean.needy.2 = {name} gets teary-eyed: I thought we were friends...
chat.mean.needy.3 = {name} sniffs hurt: Your words really hurt, you know?
chat.mean.needy.4 = {name} lowers their head sadly: You didn't have to be so rude... I was just here.
chat.mean.needy.5 = {name} says with a trembling voice: I... I thought you were a better person.
chat.mean.normal.1 = You insulted {name}! The conversation became extremely tense.
chat.mean.normal.2 = {name} ignores you coldly, turning their back.
chat.mean.normal.3 = {name} looks at you with disgust: You must have a very sad life to talk like that about others.
chat.mean.normal.4 = {name} retorts with disdain: Said the role model. Look in the mirror.
chat.mean.normal.5 = {name} answers dryly: I don't waste my time talking to your kind.

# GIFT
chat.gift.loves = {name} beams: Oh my god, {itemName}?! This is my favorite! You know me so well!
chat.gift.hates = {name} grimaces in disgust: Eww... {itemName}? I hate this! Are you trying to insult me?
chat.gift.trash = {name} frowns angrily: {itemName}? Why are you giving me trash?!
chat.gift.greedy = {name} widens their eyes: For me?! Haha, {itemName}! Finally someone who values me!
chat.gift.paranoid = {name} looks at the gift ({itemName}) suspiciously: This isn't poisoned, is it?
chat.gift.normal = {name} smiles: Wow, {itemName}! Thank you so much for the gift.

# ASSIGN PROFESSION
chat.prof.assign.unknown = {name} looks confused at the {itemName}: ...and what do I do with this? This isn't a work tool!
chat.prof.assign.already = {name}: I'm already a {profName}, forgot? I'm working on it every day!
chat.prof.assign.dislike.1 = {name} makes a disgusted face: {profName}?! Not even dead! I hate that kind of work!
chat.prof.assign.dislike.2 = {name} crosses their arms: No, thanks. {profName} is not for me. I hate it.
chat.prof.assign.dislike.3 = {name} pushes the {itemName} back: Are you kidding? I would despise being a {profName}!
chat.prof.assign.dislike.4 = {name} shakes their head: No way. {profName} is the last thing I want to be.
chat.prof.assign.lazy.1 = {name} yawns: {profName}? That's too much work... I don't have the energy for that.
chat.prof.assign.lazy.2 = {name} stretches: Heavy work? Me? Hahaha, good joke.
chat.prof.assign.lazy.3 = {name} sighs: Look, thanks for the offer, but... no can do. Too much sweat involved.
chat.prof.assign.aggressive.1 = {name} growls: {profName}?! Do I look like someone who plants little flowers?!
chat.prof.assign.aggressive.2 = {name} beats their chest: I am a warrior, not a peasant! Respect me!
chat.prof.assign.aggressive.3 = {name} spits on the ground: Too tame work for me. Give me something with action!
chat.prof.assign.angry.1 = {name} yells: I'M NOT IN THE MOOD FOR THIS! Come back later!
chat.prof.assign.angry.2 = {name} looks at you angrily: Not now! I'm too pissed off to think about a job!
chat.prof.assign.angry.3 = {name} pushes the item away: Go away! Don't come with proposals now!
chat.prof.assign.return = {name} gives you back your {profName} tools. 
chat.prof.assign.liked.1 = {name} takes the {itemName} with sparkling eyes: {profName}?! I ALWAYS wanted to do this! Thank you!
chat.prof.assign.liked.2 = {name} almost jumps with joy: Seriously, I'm going to be a {profName}?! This is my dream!
chat.prof.assign.liked.3 = {name} holds the {itemName} dearly: Finally someone recognizes my talent! I'll be the best {profName} ever!
chat.prof.assign.accept.1 = {name} takes the {itemName} and nods: Ok, {profName} sounds good. I'll do my best!
chat.prof.assign.accept.2 = {name} examines the {itemName}: Hmm, {profName}... I can try. Thanks for the opportunity!
chat.prof.assign.accept.3 = {name} smiles: {profName}? Sure! I'll start right now.
chat.prof.assign.accept.4 = {name} puts away the {itemName}: Alright, I accept being a {profName}. Count on me!
chat.prof.assign.accept.5 = {name} tests the {itemName}: I've never worked with this, but I'm excited to learn!

# COOLDOWN
chat.cooldown.friendly = {name} waves quickly: Hi, we already talked a lot today, right?
chat.cooldown.gift = {name}: More gifts? Oh, ok... thank you.
chat.cooldown.general = {name} looks busy and just mutters something.
